  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nWhen the maximum call stack size is exceeded, a RangeError object is created using isolate's current context. Thus, if a cross-origin context had been entered (through the V8WrapperInstantiationScope constructor, for example), a cross-origin exception will be propagated"
